Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:07.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我留下來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須有人留在這裡殿後
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然不論勝敗我們將無一倖存
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 一旦處於劣勢我就會逃走的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將監先生就交給你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:29.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走 延珠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.18,0:02:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,400)\pos(655,388)\fsp4\bord0}#04 黑色的子彈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.78,0:02:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是安靜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:15.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:19.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劍…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.24,0:02:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的劍在哪裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:37.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是伊熊將監嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我的劍在哪裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有…那個的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:46.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就能…繼續戰鬥…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 真讓人吃驚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然真的還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時候就要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.90,0:03:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們來做個了斷吧 裏見
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,附近的民警搭檔 就算是最近的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.01,0:03:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也要花費一個小時以上才能趕到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木更
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我叫她來的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.87,0:03:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天童社長 你認為裏見搭檔勝算如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果可以加上我個人的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為絕對會贏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？對方可是「新人類創造計劃」的倖存者啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能有勝算…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十年前 原腸動物侵入我家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(413,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吞殺了家父與家母
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:47.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為那時的壓力 我的腎臟機能基本上都停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那時 裏見蓮太郎為了保護我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:56.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被原腸動物奪去了右手 右腿和左眼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:56.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(285,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.37,0:04:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瀕死的他被送到了二十二局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:03.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主刀醫生是室戶堇醫師
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,室戶堇？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道說…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是拿不回箱子的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為有我們阻擋在你的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩次敗北 同伴全滅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.90,0:04:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 真是求之不得啊 你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.27,0:04:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要幹掉你！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.10,0:04:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天童式戰鬥術一型三號
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「轆轤鹿伏鬼」！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.87,0:04:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然打破了「最強之痛」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然是錵的義肢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(423,437)\fs21}Varanium
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:06.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要自報家門了 影胤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是前陸上自衛隊東部方面隊第七八七機械化特殊部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「新人類創造計劃」 裏見蓮太郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來還有另外一個人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原腸動物戰爭孕育的人類武器
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(289.5,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很痛…我還活著…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美好的人生！哈利路亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:39.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別欺負我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哭泣吧Sodomy 歌唱吧Gospel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們僅僅是為了殺戮而被創造出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果原腸動物戰爭再次開始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(363,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:09.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能證明我們的存在意義了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.45,0:06:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你這傢伙僅僅是為了這個目的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:14.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當你的起始者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:14.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(467,437)\fs21}Initiator
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.67,0:06:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那被詛咒的孩子身份暴露時
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.95,0:06:19.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周圍的反應如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她受到祝福了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.16,0:06:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心靈被經久不息的歡呼聲淨化了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們和我們所希望的世界是不同的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是被選中的人類
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 裏見蓮太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我一起走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別開玩笑了 你這混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你所說的未來 我絕對不能容許
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:58.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不服從我的話 就去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…要死了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延…珠…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:24.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別把人家一個人丟下！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,AGV實驗性藥物 是用原腸動物的病毒製成的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(468,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.71,0:07:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然能給予人類原腸動物般的再生能力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.71,0:07:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(437,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也會有20%的概率原腸動物化
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(537,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果可以的話最好別用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:05.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮…蓮太郎…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賭贏了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見…你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天童式戰鬥術「水天一碧架勢」！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「雲嶺毘湖鯉鮒」！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「隱禪·哭汀」！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我輸給你了嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸… 爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛭子影胤的反應消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.52,0:09:21.30,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.44,0:09:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要…爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.13,0:09:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她已經不是敵人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我遵守約定贏了 木更小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我看見了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.53,0:09:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 裏見
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有個壞消息必須告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.49,0:10:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,階段Ⅴ的原腸動物現身了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.49,0:10:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(437,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.23,0:10:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部結束了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還不能讓一切結束
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.11,0:10:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的作戰已經得到了聖天子大人的許可
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答案就在你的東南方向
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:01.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「天梯」…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.40,0:11:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由你來做 裏見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,線形超電磁投射裝置
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別名「天梯」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直徑800毫米以下的金屬飛行物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加速到亞光速射出的磁軌炮模塊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果以它無法躲避的速度
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.43,0:11:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將錵子彈射入
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.43,0:11:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(377,437)\fs21}Varanium
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.63,0:11:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是階段Ⅴ的原腸動物也一定能消滅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.63,0:11:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(437,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,線形超電磁投射裝置開始啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.53,0:11:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電力供給沒有異常
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保存液態氦的杜瓦瓶也沒有異常
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:52.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 裏見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.84,0:11:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啟動後的發動程序全部由我們這邊執行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.60,0:11:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來就只要看著就好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除此之外我們也無能為力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是階段Ⅴ嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:43.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 黃道帶原腸動物·天蠍座
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:43.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(439,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾經將世界逼至毀滅邊緣的原腸動物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(600,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見 不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.55,0:12:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,系統顯示炮膛位置異常
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:58.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也許是因為沒有填充錵制穿甲彈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:58.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(498,437)\fs21}Varanium
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:12:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 沒有子彈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:14.35,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,電力儲存系統的冷卻劑外洩 請立刻停止實驗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦 蓮太郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.31,0:13:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為磁場的影響…裏見…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在我們無法進行遠程輸入 裏見
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎…難道你…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把手臂當成子彈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然是超錵應該沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(394,437)\fs21}Varanium
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,錵填充確認
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(364,437)\fs21}Varanium
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射擊管制裝置依然無法修復
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.77,0:13:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除在管制室手動射擊外別無他法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見 你聽到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:14:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們這邊無法射出磁軌炮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.01,0:14:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了 由你來發射吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等…你在開玩笑吧 木更小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.34,0:14:08.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不到啊 木更小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.63,0:14:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見 請…拯救…世…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木更小姐 木更小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能量充填率100% 啟動手動扳機控制系統
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.40,0:14:24.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:42.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依靠手動能擊中距離五十公里外的目標嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.18,0:15:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.25,0:15:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不到…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:12.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎 人家就在你的身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:16.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如…如果我射偏了 我們就都完了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會擊中的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.77,0:15:20.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬一子彈偏離軌道擊中東京區域
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就會帶來前所未有的大災難
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:26.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 蓮太郎你一定能擊中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.35,0:15:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有蓮太郎能拯救世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是其他任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.87,0:15:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有蓮太郎…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠 我絕對不想失去你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才那句話人家可以解釋為求婚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 只是作為家人的擔憂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十歲小鬼談什麼戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經不害怕了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.25,0:16:14.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我會結束這一切
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.27,0:16:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.90,0:16:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼沒有逃走？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…被抓住了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.93,0:17:55.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是說過 一旦陷入劣勢就會逃走嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生 將監先生呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 沒錯 侵蝕率已經超過50%了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.60,0:18:23.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請讓我以人的姿態死去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:29.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定了我的存在 我不想讓你死去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我盡力了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然很辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我能活著真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在我的心中充滿了感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.63,0:19:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生沒什麼朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來做你的朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.66,0:19:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我無可替代的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你以後迷失在黑暗中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請遵從自己心中的指南針
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.67,0:19:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向著光明的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.03,0:19:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救這個世界…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情報被洩露給影胤這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.73,0:20:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經以轡田防衛大臣單方面的失控作結
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.23,0:20:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轡田剛才在看守所上吊自殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人是你的部下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原腸動物新法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(393,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是為了提高被詛咒的孩子社會地位的法案
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.65,0:20:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你卻是個頑固的歧視主義者！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.65,0:20:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公開宣佈影胤的女兒小比奈與這次恐怖事件有關聯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:29.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要讓人們對被詛咒的孩子產生反感！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.25,0:20:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了阻止原腸動物新法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.25,0:20:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(451,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至企圖召喚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.77,0:20:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能使整個東京區域大滅絕的階段Ⅴ！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼能夠忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十年前 我的妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.87,0:20:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都被屠殺的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那群小鬼繼承了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奪去了你的手腳和父母的螻蟻的血
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你卻想給予她們人權？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:21:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們才是毀滅整個世界的惡魔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.01,0:21:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:06.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 裏見蓮太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信藍原延珠！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這傢伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是不想死的話就活下去 蓮太郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.62,0:21:25.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當我因絕望而閉上雙眼的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.21,0:21:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想起了那句話 挺了過來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:30.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十年前的那一天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一刻未曾忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聖天子大人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.18,0:21:44.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有件事想要請教
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.49,0:21:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了箱子裡的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,壞掉的三輪車
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.04,0:21:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它為什麼會成為召喚天蠍座的觸媒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.91,0:22:01.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原腸動物到底是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.91,0:22:01.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(334,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.30,0:22:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請告訴我 聖天子大人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關於此事 我無可奉告
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.59,0:22:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.53,0:22:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 手臂已經痊癒了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.76,0:22:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.15,0:22:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你從菫那裡知道人家的侵蝕率檢查的結果了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.08,0:22:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是24.9%
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.06,0:22:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 幾乎沒什麼變化啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.53,0:22:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.86,0:22:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果排名上升的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.64,0:22:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,民警搭檔將會被授予特權
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.83,0:22:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虛擬階級的提升
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有機密情報的通行鑰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.64,0:22:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生 你要和延珠小姐提升排名等級
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到那時 你便會知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.57,0:23:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己是誰 為了什麼出生在這世上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.48,0:23:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs21}診斷報告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.48,0:23:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs21}侵蝕率 42.1%
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.48,0:23:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs21}形象崩潰預測值
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.48,0:23:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs21}剩餘 7.2%
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.99,0:23:40.02,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fsp4\be4\bord2}#05  紅黑色的暗殺者
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.53,0:23:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有委託
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.60,0:23:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,內容是護衛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.31,0:23:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎 人家有種不好的預感
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.54,0:23:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.83,0:23:36.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的任務是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除掉東京區域的代表聖天子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.40,0:22:17.10,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}境界の向こうに落とした
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.67,0:22:25.64,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}きっと　大切な何かを
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.56,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}（どんな言葉があるの）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.30,0:22:34.50,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}知り得るもの全部教えて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:37.71,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}（どんな顔で笑うの）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.89,0:22:43.72,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}こっそりこっちを見てよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.74,0:22:48.97,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}ねえ　初めてくれた涙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.43,0:22:54.97,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}私のココロ満たした
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.36,0:23:02.79,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}未来の約束　覚えてる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:09.10,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}小指と小指を絡めてくれた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.10,0:23:11.84,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}あなたを待つよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.27,0:23:17.24,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}いつまでも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.40,0:22:17.10,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}我一定把某件重要的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.67,0:22:25.64,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}遺失在了界限的另一邊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.56,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}（你會說些什麼呢）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.30,0:22:34.50,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}把你所知道的一切都告訴我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:37.71,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}（會帶著怎樣的神情微笑呢）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.89,0:22:43.72,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}悄悄地看看我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.74,0:22:48.97,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}你第一次為我流下的淚水
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.43,0:22:54.97,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}填滿了我的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.36,0:23:02.79,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}你曾與我相約
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:09.10,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}而我會等待你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.10,0:23:11.84,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}直到永遠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:54.11,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}ひび割れ　壊れゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.43,0:00:57.23,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}世界は果てしなく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:01:00.29,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}未知なる創造が
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:03.32,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}今秩序をなくしてる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:06.69,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}重ね合う痛みが
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.93,0:01:09.79,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}繰り返す現実
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.01,0:01:12.72,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}君との毎日が
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.81,0:01:16.01,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}その闇に身を投げた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.14,0:01:19.00,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}指し示した道を
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:22.21,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}輝かせたいから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.32,0:01:28.08,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}黒いこの銃弾が今すべてを撃ちぬく
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.18,0:01:31.28,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}赤く燃える　その眼差しに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.37,0:01:34.34,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}熱く響く　命の鼓動を
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:39.01,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}強く深く　貫いてゆく　真実を
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:43.64,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}傷だらけの心を抱いて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.77,0:01:46.67,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}ずっと明日を引き寄せるから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:51.50,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}この体にすべてを込めて戦うよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:56.71,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}希望を信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:54.11,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}世界無休止地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.43,0:00:57.23,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}變得粉碎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:01:00.29,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}未知的創造
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:03.32,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}正在破壞著秩序
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:06.69,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}累積的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.93,0:01:09.79,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}就是重複的現實
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.01,0:01:12.72,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}和你度過的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.81,0:01:16.01,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}都投身於這黑暗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.14,0:01:19.00,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}因為想要照亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:22.21,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}指引的路途
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.32,0:01:28.08,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}現在我將用這枚黑色的子彈 擊穿一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.18,0:01:31.28,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}火紅燃燒　為你的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.37,0:01:34.34,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}熱烈奏響  生命的心跳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:39.01,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}強烈深邃地貫穿真實
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:43.64,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}懷抱佈滿傷痕的心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.77,0:01:46.67,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}因為想要永遠擁抱明天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:51.50,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}我將身負一切 戰鬥下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:56.71,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}相信著希望
